s from the plan's description.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fd900b11562fd84fe","impact":0.85,"is_primary":null,"location":"Context paragraph; Approach step 1 ('Rewrite the cited_reference_accurate paragraph in both plan-review verifier prompts')","norm_id":"n234399525f39e924","priority":0.5312,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Implementer does a string replace of the quoted phrase across both files: the edit no-ops on plan_review_verifier.md because the phrase is absent, leaving the non-agentic verifier unfixed","Reviewer/implementer trusts the quoted characterization and under-specifies the non-agentic rewrite, so the two prompts diverge in behavior"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Quote each prompt's paragraph verbatim and give per-file rewrite instructions, since the agentic and non-agentic cited_reference_accurate paragraphs have different text.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.625,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"no","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"contradicts_reality","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":null,"blocking_enabled":null,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["P6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":null,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["4 criterion line(s) bundle multiple deliverables with 'and' (split so each is independently verifiable)."],"finding":"Acceptance-criteria / definition-of-done quality issues.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f607dd457c67f9209","impact":0.4,"is_primary":null,"location":"","norm_id":"ned06ebc801a522e3","priority":0.4,"reason":null,"recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Split compound criteria, replace subjective terms with observable outcomes, and state how each is verified.","tier":"DET","validity":1.0,"verification":null},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] State the per-run separation margin (how many of 3 runs the fixed vs unfixed prompt is expected to produce the surfaced/dropped outcomes) or justify why a 3-run majority is stable given the unchanged Pass-2 verifier variance, so the external regression test is not flaky in either direction.","cohort":["E3","E5","G5","T5b","T6","T9","necessity","project.failure-disposition-contract","project.portability"],"criteria":["E5"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.7437,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Approach 3: 'correct plan-citation findings must not be vetoed and the control must be, by majority of 3 runs'","Context reproduction: 'all 3 cra=yes and surfaced; control still cra=no and dropped (1 sample each)'","Approach: 'No change to ... Pass-2 verifier variance'","AC: 'The test fails on the unfixed prompt and passes on the fixed one.'"],"finding":"The live regression test asserts the fix by 'majority of 3 runs' over a non-deterministic agentic verifier whose Pass-2 variance the plan explicitly does not change, yet the reproduction evidence is only '1 sample each' — the plan does not establish that a 3-run majority reliably separates the fixed prompt (findings surfaced, control dropped) from the unfixed prompt across runs, so the AC 'fails on the unfixed prompt and passes on the fixed one' may be flaky in either direction.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f45f7c48edf2d2ea4","impact":0.33,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach step 3 / Acceptance Criteria (regression test, 'by majority of 3 runs') and Testing section","norm_id":"n35f169ba25f45cf8","priority":0.2063,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["CI/dev runs the external test with REBAR_RUN_EXTERNAL=1 and gets an intermittent pass on the unfixed prompt (or an intermittent fail on the fixed prompt) because 1-sample-each evidence does not bound 3-run-majority variance, masking regressions or producing false alarms."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Record a small multi-sample reproduction (not 1 sample each) establishing the per-run outcome distribution for fixed vs unfixed prompts, and size the run count / majority threshold to that margin; or make the assertion tolerant of known variance.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.625,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"na","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"Justify that the clarified prose reliably separates the correct-citation case from the control across verifier variance (more than one sample per arm), or state the expected pass margin for the majority-of-3 live test.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.435,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'Prompt clarified as below: all 3 `cra=yes` and surfaced; control still `cra=no` and dropped (1 sample each)'","Plan: 'No change to `pass3_decide`, Pass-2 verifier variance'","plan_review_verifier_agentic.md:191-196 — the only signal distinguishing the correct finding from the control is prose about whose citation is under test"],"finding":"The mechanism's success is demonstrated by only ONE sample per arm ('1 sample each' in Reproduction), yet the live regression test (AC item 2 / Testing) gates pass/fail on a MAJORITY of 3 runs over a known high-variance Pass-2 verifier the plan itself declines to change. The plan does not reason about whether the clarified prose reliably flips `cra=no`→`yes` for the correct findings AND reliably holds `cra=no` for the control across verifier variance — the control case is the ambiguous mirror image (its own evidence also cites a wrong location) and is precisely where a prose-only distinction is least stable.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f2e3040710c3590c2","impact":0.33,"is_primary":null,"location":"Reproduction paragraph; Acceptance Criteria item 2; Testing","norm_id":"n0c2b0c375bd6c40c","priority":0.165,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["The live majority-of-3 test flakes because the control intermittently flips to cra=yes (surfaced) or a correct finding intermittently stays cra=no under normal verifier variance"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.5,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"na","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"Specify the sampling/majority protocol and tolerance in AC2 (e.g. majority-of-N with N and the pass threshold stated) so the fail/pass flip is robust to verifier variance.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5e","T7"],"criteria":["E6","F1"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.501,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["AC2: 'The test fails on the unfixed prompt and passes on the fixed one.'","Context: veto fired 1,489 times, only 448 with evidence_entails_finding yes — behavior is stochastic.","Reproduction: 'all 3 cra=yes and surfaced; control still cra=no ... (1 sample each)'.","Approach: 'No change to ... Pass-2 verifier variance.'","AC3 offers an escape hatch ('or the result is recorded with its sidecar evidence') but AC2 provides none."],"finding":"AC2 asserts a hard binary outcome ('fails on the unfixed prompt and passes on the fixed one') for a live LLM verifier the plan itself documents as having variance, yet the regression test is majority-of-3 and the reproduction rests on '1 sample each'. The deterministic fail/pass flip may be flaky.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f1078574425fa8a0a","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Acceptance Criteria AC2; Testing section; Reproduction paragraph","norm_id":"n66a145ae22545ac4","priority":0.099,"reason":"low-validity","recalled